# The controller's landfall resolves in order: it adds a quest counter, exiles the top land and then nonland from their
# library, and lets them cast the hit from exile during this turn (CR 603.2, 608.2c, 701.13a, 701.18b).
# Exploratory Mission {2}{R}{R}: Enchantment
#   Landfall — Whenever a land you control enters, put a quest counter on this enchantment. Then exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card. You may play that card this turn. If this enchantment has five or more quest counters on it, add {R}{R}.
# Written by new-card.py --scenario: Exploratory Mission cast on turn 1 off zero-cost mana sources. Grow it a line at a time with
#   cargo run --profile cards -p cantrip-script --bin corpus -- --scenario exploratory-mission-landfall-exiles-to-nonland-and-may-play-it --next --brief
# and see which keys the card moved with --diff <the line number of its cast>.

